{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14044","headline":"省试骊珠诗 · 耿湋","name":"省试骊珠诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"是日重泉下，言探径寸珠。\n龙鳞今不逆，鱼目也应殊。\n掌上星初满，盘中月正孤。\n酬恩光莫及，照乘色难踰。\n欲问投人否，先论按劒无。\n傥怜希代价，敢对此冰壶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"耿湋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14044.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14044","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}